=1761591351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657900/extras/74db5f90458e9cc67480f88f24e09681.mp4?t=1761591351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > DISCLAIMER </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOR SALE </strong>is intended to be played in one sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOR SALE</strong> is best played with headphones on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOR SALE</strong> contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Look Where You\u2019re Driving!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/84f45213e678ce1a09f44a6cfe0721c5d7c0d23a.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019m Out of Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/fa4bb1396192f5f5a9ebe07a12487b2a97e9e9d7.jpg"},{"name":"The Gauntlet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/30a44b2d3b72ec963ade727f6da97f95315d22c1.jpg"},{"name":"Duly Noted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/9932eda3c8c6bc40fe65aaeea3d3e354b912b033.jpg"},{"name":"Mysterious Benefactor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/1775c2d26b5178ef50717cc79539d5782ef9acff.jpg"},{"name":"Cry Me a River","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/dbc5e511e7f200d3d361d37a8fbba715b6b2f47b.jpg"},{"name":"Count Cuddula","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/3c639e7c50ac8db6fcd28e0a0919b1a316b87323.jpg"},{"name":"We're Still Developing This Bear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2657900/9fc385dceda1ea73b7368b87ee802f32e3619268.jpg"},{"name":"Static Snuggles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati